{"format":1,"key":"zone:darnassus","path":"/lore/zone/darnassus","name":"Darnassus","kind":"zone","label":"Capital","zone":{"key":"darnassus","name":"Darnassus","path":"/lore/zone/darnassus"},"levels":"","description":"Darnassus shelters the night elves high among Teldrassil’s branches. Tyrande Whisperwind and the druids guide the city, where an ancient people face life…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:darnassus","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Darnassus shelters the night elves high among Teldrassil’s branches. Tyrande Whisperwind and the druids guide the city, where an ancient people face life without immortality and seek ties with the Alliance.","Darnassus spreads across Teldrassil’s upper canopy, off northern Kalimdor’s coast. Wooden buildings and winding paths circle a quiet central lake. Bridges join terraces for tradesmen, craftsmen, Sentinels, and druids, leaving the wilderness close to the city’s daily life.","Darnassus is young beside the civilization of the kaldorei. After the Third War and the sacrifice of Nordrassil at Mount Hyjal, the night elves faced aging and sickness. With Archdruid Malfurion Stormrage lost in the Emerald Dream, Archdruid Fandral Staghelm and his followers planted Teldrassil in hope of renewing their lost vitality. The city grew among its boughs as refuge and monument to their survival, though malaise already stirs among the tree’s roots.","Darnassus holds two centers of authority. High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind guides the spiritual life and defense of her people from the Temple of the Moon, with the Sentinels at her command. Across the waterways, Archdruid Fandral Staghelm leads the druids in Malfurion’s absence. Both leaders present a united face to their new Alliance partners, yet friction between the priestesses and the druidic circle lingers."],"hash":"5b6936","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"3ff6e08737","sec":81},"female-narrator":{"sha":"f45ae67e56","sec":87}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Darnassus","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Darnassus"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/temple-of-the-moon","n":"Temple of the Moon","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/cenarion-enclave","n":"Cenarion Enclave","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/rut-theran-village","n":"Rut'theran Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/tyrande-whisperwind","n":"Tyrande Whisperwind","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/fandral-staghelm","n":"Fandral Staghelm","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/topic/night-elf","n":"Night elf","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/quest/940-teldrassil","n":"Teldrassil","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/zone/ashenvale","n":"Ashenvale","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/98209-bloom-of-the-heavens","n":"Bloom of the Heavens","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/argos-nightwhisper","n":"Argos Nightwhisper","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/97914-expanding-horizons","n":"Expanding Horizons","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/93963-exploring-the-alliance","n":"Exploring the Alliance","k":"quest"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/cenarion-enclave","n":"Cenarion Enclave","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/craftsmen-s-terrace","n":"Craftsmen's Terrace","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/temple-gardens","n":"Temple Gardens","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/temple-of-the-moon","n":"Temple of the Moon","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/tradesmen-s-terrace","n":"Tradesmen's Terrace","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/warrior-s-terrace","n":"Warrior's Terrace","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/chief-archaeologist-greywhisker","n":"Chief Archaeologist Greywhisker","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/elanaria","n":"Elanaria","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/lelanai","n":"Lelanai","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/malfurion-stormrage","n":"Malfurion Stormrage","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/mathrengyl-bearwalker","n":"Mathrengyl Bearwalker","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/mydrannul","n":"Mydrannul","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/priestess-a-moora","n":"Priestess A'moora","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/priestess-alathea","n":"Priestess Alathea","k":"npc"},{